  "notes": [
    "**Terminar** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Often used with \"de\" + infinitive: *terminar de comer* (to finish eating)",
    "Can also mean \"to break up\" (relationships): *terminaron su relación* (they ended their relationship)",
    "Common usage: *terminar el trabajo* (to finish work), *terminar con alguien* (to break up with someone)"
